# Repository Layout

- `RTC-Made-Simple-Server/` — NestJS library (`@nightfuryequinn/rtc-made-simple-server`)
- `RTC-Made-Simple-UI/` — React Native library (`@nightfuryequinn/rtc-made-simple-ui`)
- `RTC-Made-Simple-Example/` — Nest backend + Expo mobile consumers

## Edit Boundaries

- Change source under each package's `src/` only
- Do not hand-edit `dist/` or `*.tgz`; rebuild with `npm run build`
- Examples depend on `file:../../RTC-Made-Simple-*` directories — rebuild libs before testing examples
- Preserve public event names (`incomingCall`, `sendMessage`, `newCall`, etc.) and `Module.forRoot` / hook signatures unless an intentional breaking change is requested

## Quality Gates

```bash
# Server
cd RTC-Made-Simple-Server && npm run typecheck && npm test && npm run build

# UI
cd RTC-Made-Simple-UI && npm run typecheck && npm test && npm run build
```

CI on `develop` must typecheck, test, and build before publish.
